          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.14.28+DEU.14.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nwo 14.28-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I mwaka me adekke, ma en aye mwakame miyo dul acel i kom apar, ibimiyo dul acel me apar me kit cam ducu ma ocek i potoni bot Lulevi, lubedo, litino kic ki mon-to wek gin bene gubed ki cam ma romogi i gaŋiwu ducu. Ka doŋ ityeko miyone botgi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci ibiwaco bot Rwot Lubaŋani ni meno, ‘Doŋ atyeko kobo jami maleŋ woko ki i oda, amiyo woko bot Lulevi, lubedo, litino kic ki mon-to kun alubo cikki ducu ma imiyo bota. Pe aturo cikki mo, pe bene wiya owil i komgi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pe acamo gin mo i kom dul acel me apar i kare ma atye ka kwero cola, pe akobo gin mo ki i oda ma onoŋo koma ki keni, pe atyero mogo bot tipo pa lato mo; doŋ aworo dogi, in Rwot Lubaŋana, atyeko tiyo gin ducu kit ma yam icika kwede, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen piny ki i kabedoni maleŋ-ŋi, nia ki i polo, ci imi gum i kom joni Icrael ki i kom lobo ma imiyowa kit ma yam ikwoŋo kwede bot kwarowa, en lobo ma mol cak ki moo kic.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
